Additional Notes:

1. Linux Kernel
   The Linux kernel included in this project is licensed under GPL-2.0.
   See: https://www.kernel.org/doc/html/latest/process/license-rules.html

2. Arch Linux Packages
   Various packages from Arch Linux ARM are included, each with their own licenses.
